### Get cross-departmental AI dashboard metrics
GET http://localhost:4007/ai/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all AI-generated safety insights and cross-departmental alerts
GET http://localhost:4007/ai/insights
Content-Type: application/json

### Get AI-tracked patient risk profiles (Monitoring Patient & Pharmacy activity)
GET http://localhost:4007/ai/patient-profiles
Content-Type: application/json
